# Validation

## Objective
The simulator was validated against a trusted stakeholder reference toolbox using a Dash 8-300 reference aircraft.

## Validation Metrics
The comparison focused on:
- propulsive thrust
- shaft power demand
- hydrogen flow rate
- cumulative hydrogen mass consumption

## Result Summary
The developed simulator achieved strong agreement with the reference model, with normalized root mean square error values below the target acceptance threshold.

## Importance
This validation demonstrates that the simulation framework is suitable as a reliable foundation for future optimization and control studies.
